    <string name="adv_attribution_note">Ranked by Android’s estimated charge in this snapshot. A UID may include several apps or system services. Charge cannot be split accurately between packages sharing a UID. Mappings may be absent for removed apps and are appId-based across profiles; they are not proof of current installation.</string>
